# AI Notes Summarizer

A simple full-stack app for summarizing uploaded notes using basic JavaScript on the front end and SQL database on the back end.

## Features
- User registration and login
- Document upload
- Text extraction from .txt, .pdf, and .docx files
- AI-style summarization using keyword scoring
- Keyword extraction
- Save summary to database
- Download notes as text file
- Admin dashboard with counts and recent data

## Tech Stack
- Front end: HTML, CSS, JavaScript
- Back end: Node.js + Express
- Database: SQLite (SQL)

## Setup

1. Install dependencies:
   ```bash
   npm install
   ```

2. Start the app:
   ```bash
   npm start
   ```

3. Open in browser:
   ```bash
   http://localhost:3000
   ```

## Default Admin
- Email: admin@notes.com
- Password: admin123

## Notes
This project is intentionally simple and beginner-friendly. The summarizer uses a keyword-based scoring method instead of a heavy AI model, making it easy to understand and customize.
